/* Tfa073 — ShapeFix_FixSmallFace.ComputeSharedEdgeForStripFace endpoint asymmetry
   Defect: strip-face shared-edge construction with asymmetric vertex merging.
   When V1 merged to V3 but V2 not merged to V4, degenerate edge created
   with one matched and one unmatched endpoint. */
